# Reconstructed pack trees — phases 3+4+6 of #114 (#118).
#
# Packs with `source: gh` in `.governance/packs.lock` are rebuilt from the
# pack cache (or working-tree resolver, #115) by
# `governance/assets/packs/lib/reconcile.sh`. The expanded copies under
# `.governance/packs/<owner>/<name>/` are reconstructable artifacts, not
# source — gitignored so a clone + reconcile produces a deterministic tree
# from the lockfile. Hand-authored packs (lockfile `source: local`) stay
# committed; the kit's own `governance-kit/core` is now `source: gh`
# (post-#117), so it gets rebuilt rather than tracked.
.governance/packs/governance-kit/
